.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
*.env
!example.env

# ---- iCloud conflict copies -------------------------------------------------
# This repo lives on a Desktop synced by iCloud, which resolves write conflicts
# by renaming files to "name 2.ext". Six of them were committed by accident
# once; they are stale snapshots of real files and must never be tracked.
# See guide.md for why .git/index also keeps disappearing here.
* [0-9].py
* [0-9].md
* [0-9].json
* [0-9].txt
